          "Title": "1.01.010 - Adoption.",
          "Content": "<div class=\"chunk-content\">\n            <p class=\"p0\">\n               There is adopted the El Paso City Code, as compiled, edited and published by Book\n               Publishing Company, Seattle, Washington, with such additions or deletions as are included\n               in Section <a href=\"\" data-chunk-id=\"TIT1GEPR_CH1.01COAD_1.01.080ADDE\" class=\"section-link\" data-product-id=\"16180\">1.01.080</a> of this chapter.\n               </p>\n            <p class=\"historynote0\">\n               (Ord. 8773 § 1, 1986)\n               </p></div>",
